  notes:
  - "\xDCst k\xF6pr\xFC g\xF6rselde tek par\xE7a; mant\u0131ksal olarak tek d\xFCz
    k\xF6pr\xFC (9 h\xFCcre)"
  - "18 Kas\u0131m d\xFCzeltmesi: 17 Kas\u0131m ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 karesi a\xE7\u0131l\u0131\u015F
    animasyonu s\u0131ras\u0131nda \xE7ekilmi\u015F (R-TRN-06, INFERRED); 6, 7, 8,
    10, 12, 15 y\u0131lanlar\u0131 ba\u015F taraf\u0131nda 2 h\xFCcre k\u0131sa okunmu\u015Ftu.
    Tam \xE7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCkl\xFC yeni ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 ekran\u0131ndan
    (18 Kas\u0131m) d\xFCzeltildi: 6 (6,24) yukar\u0131, 7 (16,24) yukar\u0131, 8
    (20,24) yukar\u0131, 10 (12,16) a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131, 12 (20,14) a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131,
    15 (8,10) sola. Di\u011Fer 13 y\u0131lan ve k\xF6pr\xFCler de\u011Fi\u015Fmedi"
  - "Greedy \xE7\xF6z\xFCl\xFCyor: 19 y\u0131lan / 23 hamle. Oyuncu kayd\u0131 (18
    Kas\u0131m): 19 y\u0131lan + 4 ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z hamle = 23, son hamlede
    kazan\u0131ld\u0131"
